{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03969","headline":"奉和幸礼部尚书窦希玠宅应制 · 刘宪","name":"奉和幸礼部尚书窦希玠宅应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北斗枢机任，西京肺腑亲。\n畴昔王门下，今兹御幸辰。\n恩光山水被，圣作管弦新。\n遶坐熏红药，当轩暗绿筠。\n摘荷才早夏，听鸟尚余春。\n行漏今徒晚，风烟起观津。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘宪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03969.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03969","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}